/**
 * UXF Inter-Wallet Transfer — UxfTransferOutboxEntry schema (T.6.A)
 *
 * Bundle-grained outbox entry per `docs/uxf/UXF-TRANSFER-PROTOCOL.md` §7.
 * Replaces the per-token legacy `OutboxEntry` (`types/txf.ts:150`) for UXF
